4. Install the SMB CSI driver through Argo CD
Since you manage your cluster with GitOps, let's keep the driver under Argo CD too.

Create:
nano apps-manifests/app-smb-csi.yaml


Use this manifest:

apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1
kind: Application
